  },
  {
    "start": 73,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "衝上來了 衝上來了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 75,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "真的很誇張耶",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 77,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "花蓮光復水淹進一層樓",
