  },
  {
    "start": 79,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "全是因為滾滾洪水襲來",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 81,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "湍急水勢夾帶土石不停宣洩而出",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 84,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "驚悚場面引爆災情",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 86,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "橋不見了 橋掉了 橋掉了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 89,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "眼前的馬太安溪橋瞬間被泥流沖斷",
