  {
    "start": 102,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "馬太安溪水位突然暴漲",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 104,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "因為上游燕色湖在二十三號下午兩點多",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 107,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "陸續發生兩波溢流",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 109,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "統計共有六千萬噸蓄水傾瀉而出",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 112,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "哇 比剛才還大 一斤高的一米多了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 117,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "你看 很像浪啊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 120,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "洪水直衝光復鄉市區",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 122,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "泰巴朗河北富村等聚落一一都被淹沒",
