  },
  {
    "start": 140,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "不知道什麼事吧 你們不要這麼放啊",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 143,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "幫護照給我變一下",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 145,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "民眾看傻了眼 不敢相信黑色泥流",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 147,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "直接衝破家門 沉了汪洋一片",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 150,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "我的天啊 媽媽 我要淹過來了啦",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 155,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "有兒子抱著行動不便的父親到屋頂避難",
