  },
  {
    "start": 160,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "下半身全是泥濘",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 162,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "我現在東西可以扶 好好好",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 165,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "花蓮縣長徐珍衛緊急作證指揮中心",
